<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
  <!--
    The one place that decides the UI fonts (Docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-17-designsystem.md, section 5.2).
    Variant A (active): the embedded Geist / Geist Mono subset in Assets/Fonts (third-party/geist/README.md).
    Variant B: the system fonts, as a fallback chain that works on both systems (Segoe UI and Cascadia Mono on
    Windows, fontconfig's sans-serif and monospace on Linux). To switch, swap the two FontFamily lines for these:
      <FontFamily x:Key="Pw.Font.Sans">Segoe UI, sans-serif</FontFamily>
      <FontFamily x:Key="Pw.Font.Mono">Cascadia Mono, Consolas, monospace</FontFamily>
    Milestone 3, Task 13 decides by measuring the start cost (measure-startup switch). No runtime logic here: the font
    is never changed after the first frame.
  -->
  <FontFamily x:Key="Pw.Font.Sans">avares://Pagewing/Assets/Fonts#Geist</FontFamily>
  <FontFamily x:Key="Pw.Font.Mono">avares://Pagewing/Assets/Fonts#Geist Mono</FontFamily>

  <!-- Fluent controls take their font from this resource, so the choice above reaches all of them. -->
  <StaticResource x:Key="ContentControlThemeFontFamily" ResourceKey="Pw.Font.Sans" />
</ResourceDictionary>
